-- Replace every council_elections.source_note with reader facing wording: it is now shown on the council
-- page as "Source: ...". Council sourced results read "<council name>'s published results", using the
-- council's name as held in councils.name (e.g. "Brent Borough Council's published results"). The LEAP rows
-- loaded on 18 Oct 2026 already read "Local Elections Archive Project (Andrew Teale), CC BY-SA 3.0" (Oldham:
-- the council's results with Royton North from LEAP) and are not changed. The page URLs the old notes held
-- stay in council_election_wards.source_url.
-- 99 rows change. Old values kept in public.council_elections_backup_20261018d.
-- Each UPDATE must change exactly one row still holding its old note, or the whole file rolls back.
\set ON_ERROR_STOP on
